{
    "id": "MiniMaxH3Ref2VAGeneratedSubject",
    "description": "Generating the subject and then referencing it. The first step draws a character with Z-Image and the second conditions MiniMax-H3's 'ref2va' on it, with 'from_previous_result' naming the step whose output the reference is built from instead of a file on disk - so nothing is written out and read back, and the whole thing is one workflow rather than two runs. An image reference takes the picture as it is; a video reference built the same way brings the frames and the soundtrack generated with them. 'release_pipeline' frees the drawing pipeline before the video model loads, since the two never need the device at once.",
    "variables": {
        "subject_prompt": "a full-body studio portrait of a weathered deep-sea diver in a brass helmet with the faceplate open, heavy canvas suit, warm rim light against a dark background, sharp and evenly lit",
        "prompt": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the deep-sea diver in <Picture 1>, in a heavy canvas suit and a brass helmet with the faceplate open, whose face, helmet, suit and proportions define their appearance for the whole video.\n\nsummary:\n[image reference] The target video shows <Subject 1> speaking directly to camera in the setting of <Picture 1>, in one continuous take.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - the face, helmet, suit and proportions of <Picture 1> are kept exactly, with the head, jaw and shoulders newly animated to speak.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is in realistic photographic style. [Shot 1] A medium close-up frames <Subject 1> from the chest up, centred and facing camera in the setting of <Picture 1>, held as one continuous shot. The lighting of <Picture 1> is kept exactly as it is, the warm rim light steady along the brass of the helmet and the background staying dark and well behind in shallow focus. <Subject 1> (S1), a low and gravelled male voice, unhurried and worn, says <d>[English] Down there the light gives out first. Everything else follows.</d> The jaw and lips move in natural synchronisation with the speech and settle closed at the end of the line. Between phrases <Subject 1> shifts weight very slightly and the head drifts a few degrees off centre and back, with the eyes staying on the lens and blinking at a natural rate. The camera holds a static shot throughout.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nA quiet, close room tone at an even level from the first frame to the last, with a faint creak of canvas as <Subject 1> shifts weight and a single soft knock of a glove against the brass collar.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nNone.",
        "num_frames": 124,
        "width": 960,
        "height": 544,
        "num_inference_steps": 20,
        "weights_dtype": "{int4}"
    },
    "steps": [
        {
            "name": "draw_subject",
            "release_pipeline": true,
            "pipeline": {
                "configuration": {
                    "component_type": "ZImagePipeline",
                    "offload": "sequential"
                },
                "from_pretrained_arguments": {
                    "model_name": "Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image-Turbo",
                    "torch_dtype": "torch.bfloat16",
                    "low_cpu_mem_usage": true
                },
                "arguments": {
                    "prompt": "variable:subject_prompt",
                    "num_inference_steps": 9,
                    "guidance_scale": 0.0,
                    "width": 768,
                    "height": 768
                }
            },
            "result": {
                "content_type": "image/jpeg",
                "embed_metadata": true
            }
        },
        {
            "name": "reference_to_video_audio",
            "pipeline": {
                "configuration": {
                    "component_type": "ModularPipeline",
                    "pre_load_modules": [
                        "sdnq"
                    ],
                    "cache": {
                        "type": "first_block",
                        "threshold": 0.1
                    },
                    "load_components": {
                        "dtype": "torch.bfloat16",
                        "quantization_config": {
                            "transformer_ref": {
                                "configuration": {
                                    "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                                },
                                "arguments": {
                                    "weights_dtype": "variable:weights_dtype",
                                    "quantization_device": "cuda",
                                    "return_device": "cpu",
                                    "use_quantized_matmul": true,
                                    "dequantize_fp32": false,
                                    "modules_to_not_convert": [
                                        "proj_in",
                                        "audio_proj_in",
                                        "context_embedder",
                                        "time_embedder",
                                        "time_proj",
                                        "token_refiner",
                                        "norm_out",
                                        "proj_out",
                                        "audio_proj_out"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "text_encoder": {
                                "configuration": {
                                    "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                                },
                                "arguments": {
                                    "weights_dtype": "variable:weights_dtype",
                                    "quantization_device": "cuda",
                                    "return_device": "cpu",
                                    "dequantize_fp32": false,
                                    "modules_to_not_convert": [
                                        ".model.visual",
                                        "lm_head"
                                    ]
                                }
                            },
                            "vae": {
                                "configuration": {
                                    "config_type": "sdnq.SDNQConfig"
                                },
                                "arguments": {
                                    "weights_dtype": "{int8}",
                                    "quant_conv": true,
                                    "use_quantized_matmul_conv": true,
                                    "quantization_device": "cuda",
                                    "return_device": "cpu",
                                    "dequantize_fp32": false
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "components": {
                        "transformer_ref": {
                            "group_offload": {
                                "offload_type": "block_level",
                                "num_blocks_per_group": 1,
                                "use_stream": true,
                                "record_stream": true,
                                "low_cpu_mem_usage": true
                            }
                        },
                        "text_encoder": {
                            "remove_modules": [
                                "lm_head"
                            ]
                        },
                        "text_encoder.model": {
                            "truncate_layers": {
                                "language_model.layers": 51
                            },
                            "group_offload": {
                                "offload_type": "leaf_level"
                            }
                        },
                        "vae": {
                            "device": "cuda",
                            "residency": "on_demand"
                        },
                        "audio_vae": {
                            "device": "cuda",
                            "residency": "on_demand"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "from_pretrained_arguments": {
                    "model_name": "MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-H3",
                    "workflow": "ref2va"
                },
                "arguments": {
                    "prompt": "variable:prompt",
                    "references": [
                        {
                            "reference_type": "diffusers.modular_pipelines.minimax_h3.MiniMaxH3ImageReference",
                            "from_previous_result": "draw_subject"
                        }
                    ],
                    "num_frames": "variable:num_frames",
                    "width": "variable:width",
                    "height": "variable:height",
                    "num_inference_steps": "variable:num_inference_steps",
                    "output": [
                        "videos",
                        "audio",
                        "sampling_rate"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "result": {
                "content_type": "video/mp4",
                "fps": 24
            }
        }
    ]
}
